		{
			"id":"note-batching",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## Result: 2 batches per table\n\nTwo risks give two flushes, so each table receives 2 insert batches instead of one INSERT per row.\n\nRequires `hibernate.jdbc.batch_size=50`, `order_inserts=true`, `order_updates=true`, and SEQUENCE ids (IDENTITY disables batching).",
			"codemap":{"kind":"note","title":"Result: 2 batches per table","category":"note","text":"Two risks give two flushes, so each table receives 2 insert batches instead of one INSERT per row.\n\nRequires `hibernate.jdbc.batch_size=50`, `order_inserts=true`, `order_updates=true`, and SEQUENCE ids (IDENTITY disables batching)."},
